  "notes": "びっくり is an onomatopoeia expressing sudden surprise.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- びっくりする (to be surprised)\n- びっくりさせる (to surprise someone)\n- びっくりするほど〜 (surprisingly ~)\n- びっくり{仰天|ぎょうてん} (great astonishment)\n\nRELATED EXPRESSIONS:\n- {驚|おどろ}く: to be surprised (more formal)\n- ビックリ: katakana variation\n- {吃驚|びっくり}: kanji spelling (rarely used)",
